              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• 以后接 DATA_QUERY：事务外调用 data-service，结果另开短事务落库；失败、超时、CDC 秒级延迟都只算「尚未通过」，可重试；SQL 有问题到 data-service 改完再触发验证",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
